  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Do pasto ao prato - a step-change in transparency of the domestic meat market in Brazil: TRASE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will dramatically increase transparency in the Brazilian domestic market for meat products, by building a
unique, crowd-sourced database identifying which companies commercialise meat products linked to deforestation and other unsustainable practices.</narrative>
  </description>
